{"version":1,"key":"article:62","content":{"id":62,"title":"使用 Github Actions 部署 VuePress 博客","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc53bae5-5031-42fd-9289-2706f6414dfd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随着我 VuePress 博客中的东西越来越多，每次我打包好项目然后上传到 Github 上需要好一会儿时间，之前在一些文章中知道 Github Actions 可以帮我自动部署项目，正好今天尝试尝试。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8ef518cf-58ef-40b9-9de9-05aa69d15a8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在使用 Github Actions 以前，部署过程是这样的："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"9041652d-8937-45a5-925b-f07925aad769","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8fed04ad-626c-4b2c-96fc-73befc3ad717","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a14fd36c-238e-4c91-879f-39c187d98b09","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写文章"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"74cf44d4-5589-49d9-9c73-5972b53a9287","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70b28954-c7e1-45f1-92ed-080a39b1b715","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"生成静态文件"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f81ff5bf-dd3c-4fdf-8b2a-20daf3d67662","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"494c33e7-0ba9-4257-8b05-129f3ad98e5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将静态文件部署到 Github Page 上"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d188e6bb-98e2-40ec-85af-6d96acfdeb65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用了 Github Actions 后，过程变为了："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"7332e07d-5219-4292-872d-1f901659092e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c3f89bd2-08a6-461f-b688-edaa68d9974b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d7e02b11-20b1-4f3f-8d6c-e6fa3543e7f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写文章"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4057fb8f-3ab3-427a-bca1-f877480eb66a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a21908a-2c82-48c5-aac4-e3d332b39662","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提交文章到 Github 上"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3afd211d-4f0d-4042-9ad5-7b77c85e6d36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置文件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"effbef1f-f77b-4475-85ef-3bd2ad5cf8b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着我们介绍如何使用这一利器。首先你需要在你的项目下新建 .github/workflows/ 文件夹，接着在 workflows 文件夹下新增 xxx.yml 文件，这个文件名随意，但是必须是 YAML 文件，比如我新增文件名为 deploy.yml，给出我的配置内容(去掉了一些个性化的配置)"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"cc2fc938-914a-4dc0-8300-8a67ac719487","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"23683f1b-f005-4ee1-94fa-aab13230b372","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"name: Build and Deploy\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - master\njobs:\n  build-and-deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout 🛎️\n        uses: actions/checkout@v2.3.1\n\n      - name: Install and Build 🔧 \n        run: |\n          npm install\n          npm run build\n\n      - name: Deploy 🚀\n        uses: JamesIves/github-pages-deploy-action@4.1.3\n        with:\n          BRANCH: gh-pages\n          FOLDER: docs/.vuepress/dist\n          ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.ACCESS_TOKEN }}","collabId":"5b73a74e-6546-4d92-90a9-414a8f34e8cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7806774d-96fc-4dd1-b943-950d182859d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当你向 Github 提交代码时，它会自动的检测 .github/workflows/ 目录，如果有配置的话，就会根据你的配置 workflow 自动部署项目。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"424c6bd2-605d-4e2c-8f97-cfd23ca513a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从上面的配置看，主要分为三个部分："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"325bd0a4-060a-445a-9445-1cff238d2285","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"db618ef9-b9ef-4275-842d-5362479cc61a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8ae3a271-19c5-4ba8-8c73-40c712ffe48e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"name：这个 workflow 的名称，自己随便取"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4d5e41d3-fca1-4f7c-98e6-9c1472c603e7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb9966ae-fe64-4ea5-8f69-6abf5fd99a4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"on：触发条件"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"950a9a7f-9cbc-4ef0-828c-0104c8fba30e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"31c58fb5-92f7-4f5d-b1a1-aa1dbe92b5f5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"on:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - master","collabId":"8015c8d7-c247-41fd-9673-6036ac374c8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"51cb8c51-c00d-4e42-9c9c-f99755d4ee83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述表示当我们向 master 分支 push 时就会触发该 workflow"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f2b06cec-76a3-454a-8152-33aa26805421","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64253ae2-7543-40c9-b6e2-a329c2e20e23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"jobs：规定要执行的任务，例如上面我们定义了一个任务 build-and-deploy，每个任务包含如下配置"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"401608a9-a5ea-4dd8-a5da-4e64f23b030a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"aa4e4e27-c104-4e82-b048-666255fb0e4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2ddd5a14-2863-45ee-a6ef-dd44671fab3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"runs-on：运行所需要的虚拟机环境，Github 为我们提供了如下环境"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"70d574fe-0739-4b66-8526-c2af42b34fd2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6915be27-7fda-4306-a224-568d39995472","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ca93195a-a5f2-4ee4-8d4b-e4dd7b68d123","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ubuntu-latest，ubuntu-18.04或ubuntu-16.04"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"21d4e95c-ab17-4ac8-b9a2-b07ad4634237","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0c9b530-3fbc-4c20-b5db-282cfc6e6f26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"windows-latest，windows-2019或windows-2016"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"834b8246-8190-4cc4-a588-2df7be5438cc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7358b2d7-e887-45b9-bd40-ebbeeaf7bcca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"macOS-latest或macOS-10.14"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4beaa14f-e74b-4e20-8b79-242e96af06ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里我们选择了 ubuntu-latest"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"410eda76-f8c5-4025-bc19-9f1baae3fdec","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9666ec40-6605-492a-8a66-798bc7ba9bf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"steps：任务运行的步骤"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a297dce-a344-4fac-bcb7-1e19229ba36b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着我们对我们运行的步骤进行说明，我们的步骤包含三步，第一步是拉取主分支的代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"1d4610b8-d830-4af2-b313-07a866643482","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4db2876e-0975-420c-9b8e-d5fec13f273a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"- name: Checkout 🛎️\n  uses: actions/checkout@v2.3.1","collabId":"d9b932bb-e7ca-4043-a24c-9654199bf88d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"464e6323-4d03-4ef0-b992-5470a83242fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二步，运行两个命令 npm install 与 npm run build"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"3c4e00f1-6267-4398-b6bb-c4682c92e7bf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f4cc7e5f-2a8e-4052-a546-8731cf2d3bc6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"- name: Install and Build 🔧 \n  run: |\n    npm install\n    npm run build","collabId":"0864b648-911d-46ca-bd72-4c54ee3e9b3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d094f01-935e-43d0-8167-a2001b8c3ee5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第三步，将 生成的静态文件夹部署到 gh-pages 分支上"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"7cb4568e-3b66-4c94-ba85-1fad9dc9735d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5ecc0893-a799-4d94-be73-92d132deb27d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"- name: Deploy 🚀\n  uses: JamesIves/github-pages-deploy-action@4.1.3\n  with:\n    BRANCH: gh-pages\n    FOLDER: docs/.vuepress/dist\n    ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.ACCESS_TOKEN }}","collabId":"6e275781-8d7f-435d-80b8-2c5d5c1994da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e8b38d4d-2f89-4e01-84d1-41ef28476468","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置密钥"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ee1ce074-ea8e-47cc-b61b-8795fb08289d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 Github Actions 是需要 ACCESS-TOKEN，既然都已经会使用 Github 了，就肯定知道这个东西怎么生成了，如果不会，请求参照"},{"type":"link","url":"https://docs.github.com/en/github/authenticating-to-github/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/creating-a-personal-access-token","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"009dd88a-88ac-4472-afde-e78af8fb12d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"官方文档"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9d41d22-6d13-4785-a8df-a697dcfe7a12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要在仓库的 Setting 中选择 Secrets"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_49b2ff9a-aa7d-4f2c-8381-42aa2291ed4e.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"38283301-8001-442a-b55f-6f274257cc0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2cf8ec57-e54c-494a-af44-aadbf8662f52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击右上方的 New repository secret"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f10ef731-691a-437d-99e5-00cc2a254db0.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"00b133d5-faba-475b-81ea-d74743af99f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d2d9d28-c7b5-4fc8-97cb-56403b0ce25d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Name 必须写为 ACCESS_TOKEN，Value 就是你的 token，填写完毕点击 Add secret，如果填写没有问题的话，点击之后就会提示添加成功。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"935bc22b-9f80-4431-9b54-ae37aae0130c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次当你将 Vuepress 项目提交到 Github 上的时候，Github 就会自动帮你部署项目。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_89703d06-e9db-411c-8bb9-52179d5736ac.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"356bd8c3-2972-44c5-b544-7b3d7fb284d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5ed452ce-2d5b-43c3-a3b4-6ba1cf98edd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Actions 的这个选项中可以看到项目的部署情况，上面可以看到我尝试了三次，第三次成功了，前两次是踩坑，下面就介绍了我踩的两次坑。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0e26af45-e791-433b-b99a-d34e2b07aa20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"踩坑"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ffdea8a4-4f27-49a4-b4e0-ca86952cd2e3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 VuePress 官网上面，给出的构建脚本命令是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"shell","uuid":"35e191bf-7303-4088-b237-b4ea48eb74e9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2611557a-a820-4a68-a764-e2f999abe3bc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"npm run docs:build","collabId":"226ee4dc-199c-4da9-bfc2-e75671130207","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b294ad1-acf6-495f-85d0-3b4d456742c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我觉得麻烦，改为了 npm run build，所以第一次运行的时候，就提示我没有这个脚本"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_795570c7-11c1-4c7e-8b8f-fe2684ddbd6b.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"cdabc7bd-bcc7-49ea-b081-c2db53415ee8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e759c9f-03dd-4261-be48-a183049fcfd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我改过来了，所以如果你构建的脚本命令和我的不一致的话，还是要改的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c43db9a3-0d2b-466b-bc4e-1a9a59aac70d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个坑，上面配置好了以后，我将我的 VuePress 博客提交到 Github，但是运行一段时间之后爆出了错误"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_647cbdef-f4a6-4989-abea-2c786d65acd8.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6495d348-831f-4cf9-977b-c883827160b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f23f1aee-a4b3-4acf-9da8-087a25aa2303","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从错误的类型看好像是超内存了，然后经过我的搜索，在 Github 的一个 issue 中找到了"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/ScaCap/action-surefire-report/issues/17#issuecomment-677015255","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"692172eb-9177-451a-8f19-d7e10e21b5cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，添加下面的环境变量"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"a6d83431-b06f-407c-b701-081a7deeaeb0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7dd94869-fde4-4ad4-ae39-44a47afbf016","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"env:\n  NODE_OPTIONS: '--max_old_space_size=4096'","collabId":"bcd1031e-5e02-4b69-8094-5274c7b7a434","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b561a051-4e5a-4ee4-8f47-3c5112875fba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更改后的配置文件如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"4e5b8009-9839-44e2-9268-500a9c2bd664","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"34e50da0-250b-4850-a732-297b427e8778","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"name: Build and Deploy\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - master\njobs:\n  build-and-deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout 🛎️\n        uses: actions/checkout@v2.3.1\n\n      - name: Install and Build 🔧 \n        run: |\n          npm install\n          npm run build\n        env:\n          NODE_OPTIONS: '--max_old_space_size=4096'\n\n      - name: Deploy 🚀\n        uses: JamesIves/github-pages-deploy-action@4.1.3\n        with:\n          BRANCH: gh-pages\n          FOLDER: docs/.vuepress/dist\n          ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.ACCESS_TOKEN }}","collabId":"7f2c4126-046c-4c69-ab6b-563c3b435a34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/tabea-schimpf-W9ZIbpOzcoA-unsplash_cc72578b-8309-4837-9019-7e0fa3c2ec99.jpg","createTime":1622445611000,"updateTime":1743303640485},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1743303640485}}